        {"zh": "桶是我们的交通工具。", "en": "Bucket is our transport."},
        {"zh": "请小心，我的牙齿很锋利。", "en": "Be careful, my teeth are sharp."},
        {"zh": "我适合在鱼缸里养。", "en": "I thrive in aquariums."},
        {"zh": "水草能帮助我呼吸。", "en": "Grass helps me breathe."},
