        {"zh": "桶里不是你的家。", "en": "Bucket's not your home."},
        {"zh": "别以为躲水里就能逃。", "en": "Can't hide in water from me."},
        {"zh": "靠近些，让我品尝你。", "en": "Come closer, let me taste you."},
